.TH BACKUP-SEADRIVE 1 "October 2026" "scripts" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
backup-seadrive \- resilient encrypted incremental backup from SeaDrive to Google Drive via Rclone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B backup-seadrive
[\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
[\fB\-\-setup-timer\fR]
[\fB\-\-remove-timer\fR]
[\fB\-\-status\fR]
[\fB\-\-force\fR]
[\fB\-\-dry-run\fR]
[\fB\-\-auto\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBbackup-seadrive\fR synchronizes files from a local \fBSeaDrive\fR virtual mount
(\fB~/SeaDrive/My Libraries\fR) directly to a Zero-Knowledge encrypted Google Drive
destination (\fBgdrive-crypt:SeafileBackup\fR) using \fBrclone\fR.
.PP
Files and filenames are encrypted on-the-fly in RAM before reaching Google Drive.
Only new and modified files are transferred (delta sync).
.PP
The utility features built-in resilience against offline system boots and roaming network interruptions.
When the system starts without an internet connection or before SeaDrive is mounted, the scheduled job safely defers execution and retries on subsequent timer checks once connectivity is restored.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Displays brief command-line help and exits.
.TP
.B \-\-setup-timer
Installs and enables a resilient periodic systemd user timer (\fBseafile-backup.timer\fR).
The timer checks every 15 minutes and executes the backup once per day (~20 hour cooldown) as soon as network and SeaDrive are ready.
.TP
.B \-\-remove-timer
Stops, disables, and deletes the systemd user service and timer.
.TP
.B \-\-status
Displays systemd timer status, cooldown state (last run and elapsed time), current prerequisite health (network, mount, rclone), and recent log entries.
.TP
.B \-\-force
Forces an immediate backup run, bypassing cooldown interval and flock checks.
.TP
.B \-\-dry-run
Performs a trial run without transferring or writing any data to the remote.
.TP
.B \-\-auto
Automated execution flag used by the systemd service. Enforces cooldown restrictions and silent deferred exits when prerequisites are not met.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SEADRIVE_SOURCE
Path to the local SeaDrive libraries mount (default: \fB$HOME/SeaDrive/My Libraries\fR).
.TP
.B RCLONE_DEST
Target encrypted remote and path (default: \fBgdrive-crypt:SeafileBackup\fR).
.TP
.B LOG_DIR
Directory for execution logs (default: \fB$HOME/.cache/rclone\fR).
.TP
.B BACKUP_INTERVAL_HOURS
Minimum cooldown interval in hours between automatic backups (default: \fB20\fR).
.TP
.B CHECK_INTERVAL
Systemd user timer poll frequency (default: \fB15m\fR).
.TP
.B WAIT_ONLINE_TIMEOUT
Seconds to wait for network connectivity and SeaDrive mount at boot before deferring (default: \fB25\fR).
.SH REQUIREMENTS
Requires \fBrclone\fR, a configured \fBgdrive-crypt\fR remote, and a mounted \fBSeaDrive\fR instance.
